    {
      "info": "Varde 4: the site is rebuilt and deployed\nScope: medium-grained, as-is, digitalized\nRuns on every push to main, daily at 04:00 UTC and on demand. The API only lives inside this job: it starts against Neon, hands its data over as JSON and stops. Nothing user-facing talks to it. Story 1 picks up where Pages serves the site."
